@@ -29,6 +29,9 @@ Changed
 Fixed
 ~~~~~
 
+- The `colors.webpage.darkmode.threshold.foreground` setting now controls the
+  foreground brightness threshold with QtWebEngine 6.4 and newer. The old
+  `colors.webpage.darkmode.threshold.text` name continues to work.
